        "text_cx7Qkt": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "question": "What's in the box",
            "answer": "<ul><li>1 x AISI 304 Stainless Steel 8k finish housing unit.</li><li>1 x AISI 304 Stainless Steel Spigot for easy-access hydration.</li><li>2 x Activated Carbon Filter Elements.</li><li>(Optional) 2 x POSTreat Fluoride Removal Filter Elements.</li></ul><p></p><p>The Phoenix Gravity System is easy to set up for any countertop in your home or workplace, no plumber or electricity required.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_3pC3Fj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "question": "100-Day Risk-Free Trial",
            "answer": "<p>Worried the Phoenix Gravity Water Filter is too good to be true? Don’t believe it will really remove as many contaminants as we promise?<br/><br/>We stand behind our product 100% – so you can try our filter in your own home for 100 days risk-free. If you aren't fully satisfied with the purity of your water, send it back within 100 days for a full refund, no questions asked!<br/><br/>*T&Cs apply<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "text_rWr6i4": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Maintenance & Care",
            "answer": "{{ product.metafields.custom.maintenance_care | metafield_tag }}"
          }
        },
        "text_WJ7Gm4": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "question": "Technical Specifications",
            "answer": ""
          }
        },
        "text_9wn3cB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Powerful Filtration, Pure Water",
            "answer": "<ul><li>Removes chlorine, heavy metals, drug residues, estrogens, and microplastics</li><li>Retains essential minerals like magnesium and calcium</li><li>Does NOT alter TDS – The Total Dissolved Solids (TDS) remain unchanged</li><li>Enhances the taste and odor of tap water</li><li>Fast & Efficient filtration process</li><li>Easy to replace filters</li><li>Compatible with all water sources</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "text_4aC3aG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Shipping & Returns",
            "answer": "<p><strong>100-Day Money-Back Guarantee :</strong></p><p>The 100-day money-back guarantee applies exclusively to filter systems purchased directly from <strong>www.phoenixwaterfilters.com</strong>.</p><p><strong>Return Process :</strong></p><p>To initiate a return, customers must contact our customer support team and provide valid website order details. Once the details are validated, the support team will approve the return and share detailed instructions on how and where to send the product.</p><p><strong>Important Notes :</strong></p><ul><li>Products returned without prior authorization will not be accepted.</li><li>Products must be returned in their original packaging and must be free from any damage.</li></ul><p><strong>Shipping :</strong></p><p>NOTE: Most orders will be processed and shipped within 3-7 business days. We appreciate your patience.</p><p>We Ship Anywhere! Within the USA. Phoenix Gravity’s free shipping offer applies to retail customer orders with a minimum amount of $99.99 shipped domestically (within the US). Orders are normally shipped via UPS ground service, USPS Priority Mail, or USPS First Class mail. Please note that UPS does not ship to PO Boxes or Military Addresses. </p><p><strong>Orders & Damaged Goods:</strong></p><p>If your order was damaged or defective during delivery, or there was an error in your order, ex. If the filters are broken or the size of the filter system is incorrect, please contact our Customer Service within 4 days of delivery receipt at 1 (800) 917-0455 or email us at <a href=\"mailto:hello@phoenixwaterfilters.com\" title=\"hello@phoenixwaterfilters.com\">hello@phoenixwaterfilters.com</a>. We will make every effort to correct your order. If you were shipped an incorrect item, Phoenix Gravity will pay for the return via standard shipping to the registered address. Please make sure you include your order ID and order date.</p><p><strong>Cancellation Policy:</strong></p><p>You cannot cancel the order once your order is been dispatched. Dispatched orders will be notified via registered email IDs.<br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
