    "secondary_details_qTHLFy": {
      "type": "secondary-details",
      "custom_css": [
        "h2 {margin-top: 30px;}"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "style": "bg-white",
        "heading": "Revolutionary ‘Nano adsorption’ filter technology",
        "content": "<p>Traditional filters simply trap unwanted pollutants, allowing them to accumulate and multiply where they become a breeding ground for contaminants within just two weeks - instantly contaminating any water that passes through it. To solve this crucial problem, we’ve developed revolutionary ‘Nano adsorption’ technology. How does it work?<br/><br/>First, we use granular activated carbon derived from natural coconut husks to remove chemicals, toxins, and heavy metals such as zinc and lead. Then we’ve impregnated every filter with carbon adsorbents to prevent contaminant growth inside the filter itself.</p>",
        "buttonlink": "",
        "buttontext": "",
        "afterbutton": "",
        "custom_id": ""
      }
    },
