      ],
      "settings": {
        "style": "bg-white",
        "layout": "copy",
        "vertical_align": "align-items-center",
        "heading": "Engineered to last using premium quality materials",
        "content": "<p>Most filters are made from plastic that leach harmful chemicals into your drinking water. We use natural kiln-fired carbon filtration from the southern province of Spain, as well as granular activated carbon from natural coconut husks to remove nasties and heavy metals like lead and zinc. All of this complex natural filtration is perfectly housed in the highest-food grade AISI 304 Stainless Steel known to man. It’s a refined and durable filtration system that’ll give you crisp, clean drinking water for years to come.</p>",
