      "settings": {
        "style": "bg-white",
        "layout": "copy-image-copy",
        "vertical_align": "align-items-center",
        "heading": "Save $1,000s on bottled water or A whole-home system",
        "content": "<p>Bottled water might be clean, but it’s also expensive. It’ll cost you over $1,000 per year, create waste that harms the environment, and take up a LOT of space in your home. You could install an in-home system, but they’re costly too – not only is there a substantial upfront investment, but you have to pay for ongoing maintenance and repairs. Plus you can’t take it with you if you’re renting or decide to sell your home. Phoenix Gravity Water Filters are a more convenient and affordable solution, while still giving you access to delicious filtered water every day!</p>",
        "column_img": "shopify://shop_images/filter-system.png",
        "video_id": "",
        "img_width": 0,
        "large_image": "img-standard",
        "second_content": "",
