    "copy_image_DfRFKh": {
      "type": "copy-image",
      "settings": {
        "style": "bg-light",
        "layout": "image-copy",
        "vertical_align": "align-items-center",
        "heading": "WARNING: Drinking tap water makes 7.2 million americans sick every year!",
        "content": "<p>Every year, millions of Americans fall sick by ingesting harmful chemicals through tap water. In Baltimore, they recently detected a parasite in the drinking water… in California’s Coachella Valley, they found water from fast-food soda fountains contained salmonella… and in Iowa, they identified unsafe amounts of nitrate and alachlor.<br/><br/>These chemicals have been linked to a range of dangerous side effects - liver and kidney damage, thyroid disease, cancer and even “blue baby syndrome” in infants. Phoenix Gravity Water Filters use a powerful Nano Toxin filter technology to remove 99.9% of contaminants from tap water, making it safe to drink in any city in America!</p>",
        "video_id": "",
        "large_image": "img-lrg",
        "second_content": "",
        "buttonlink": "",
        "buttontext": "",
        "afterbutton": "",
        "custom_id": "",
        "custom_class": "",
        "section_bgimg": "shopify://shop_images/tap-water.jpg",
        "bg_image_style": "cover",
        "section_randoimg_position": "top"
      }
    },
    "copy_image_yifhAn": {
      "type": "copy-image",
      "settings": {
        "style": "bg-white",
        "layout": "copy",
        "vertical_align": "align-items-center",
        "heading": "Why risk ingesting harmful toxins when you can drink fresh, clean water that’s completely safe?",
        "content": "<p>Your tap water could easily be contaminated without you knowing. Germs and chemicals come from nearby farms, sewage overflows, industrial operations or even stormwater. Chemicals such as lead, copper and nitrate can leach into your drinking water at the water’s source, or in the distribution system after the water has already been treated!<br/><br/>Why take the risk when you don’t know exactly what’s lurking in your drinking water? Phoenix Gravity Water Filters can take dirty water and eliminate 99.9% of contaminants instantly. It tastes great and you get peace of mind knowing it’s safe for the whole family to drink!</p>",
        "video_id": "",
        "large_image": "img-standard",
        "second_content": "",
        "buttonlink": "#addtocart",
