          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Filter Out 99.9% Of Contaminants",
            "copy": "<p>AISI 304 Stainless Steel is lightweight, rust-resistant, and durable</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/icon-water.svg",
            "video_id": ""
          }
        },
        "text_4XRwdm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Save A Fortune On Bottles Or A Whole-Home System",
            "copy": "<p>Why spend $1,000s on bottled water or buy an expensive in-home system when you can enjoy safe, delicious water for a fraction of the cost?</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/icon-bottle_ff07ad97-f9a4-42a8-a9bb-ee0b172d9458.svg",
            "video_id": ""
          }
        },
        "text_BzeGeE": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Lightweight And Easy To Move Or Carry Around",
            "copy": "<p>Phoenix Water Filters are lightweight and portable – you can carry them from home, to work, to camping trips and back!</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/icon-scales_bbf132a3-2ee0-4790-b250-ec80e2bd5d7f.svg",
            "video_id": ""
          }
        },
        "text_6fa9wW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Built To Last Up To 10 Years Or More",
            "copy": "<p>Made from quality AISI 304 Stainless Steel, Phoenix Gravity Water Filters are backed by a 10-year warranty to give you added peace of mind!</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/icon-time_22302494-3a88-4cf5-b70b-b40949aed71d.svg",
            "video_id": ""
          }
